    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mang Ojek: Driving Test</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to prove your skills as a professional motorcycle rider!<br>Step into the world of <i>Mang Ojek</i>, where precision, speed, and control are everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Mang Ojek: Driving Test</strong>, you'll tackle two core challenges: the <strong>Motorcycle Driving Test</strong>, where you must conquer obstacle-filled tracks, and the <strong>Ojek Test</strong>, a high-pressure delivery challenge where you transport passengers, food, and packages under tight time limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete for the best times, master your two-wheeled vehicle, and rise through the global ranks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfcd\ufe0f <strong>Driving Test Mode</strong> \u2013 Complete technical riding challenges to earn your spot on the road.<br>\ud83d\udef5 <strong>Ojek Test Mode</strong> \u2013 Simulate real-world delivery tasks with strict timing and precision.<br>\u23f1\ufe0f <strong>Time-Limited Levels</strong> \u2013 Push yourself to finish each stage with speed and accuracy.<br>\ud83d\udcca <strong>Global Leaderboards</strong> \u2013 Show off your best runs and compete with players worldwide.<br>\ud83c\udfae <strong>Realistic Motorcycle Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Ride with responsive two-wheeled control physics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mang Ojek: Driving Test</strong> is part of the broader <i>Mang Ojek</i> experience\u2014an expanding series of games inspired by the fast-paced life of motorcycle delivery drivers. Whether you're chasing the leaderboard or perfecting your ride, this is your chance to rev up and show your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Your feedback and support mean a lot!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every suggestion, review, and word of encouragement helps shape the future of <i>Mang Ojek</i>. Thank you for riding with us! \ud83c\udfcd\ufe0f\ud83d\udcac</p>",
